# Python Fundamentals Practice

This repository contains my Python practice as I learn programming for AI/ML engineering.

## Topics Covered
- Python variables and data types
- Lists and indexing
- List length using `len()`
- Adding elements using `append()` and `insert()`
- Removing elements using `remove()` and `pop()`
- Sorting lists using `sort()`
- Reversing lists using `reverse()`

## Goal
To strengthen my Python fundamentals before learning NumPy, Pandas, and Machine Learning.

## Language
Python